            "created_at": "2025-08-15T10:50:29.432554+00:00",
            "notes": "Picking whatever power we didn't choose in round 3. If you don't prefer to have the 2nd coach gun shot, you can go with [Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b) to help with dynamite cooldowns. I personally prefer the coach gun to help with getting on high ground and out of sticky situations. It all depends on your playstyle.\n\nIf at this point you have [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739) as a power, then I'd recommend going for [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). \n\nAn optional choice is [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) to help us get BOB faster and buff our burn even more. [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) can also be a good choice if you're against a lot of flyers (Mercy, Juno, Freja).\n\nSpend any leftover cash building AP.",
